Session 1 – Maximum Subarray: Brute Force → Optimized
Task 1: Maximum Subarray – LeetCode
Approach 1: Brute Force
Check every possible subarray and calculate its sum.
class Solution {
    public int maxSubArray(int[] nums) {

        int maxSum = nums[0];

        for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {

            int sum = 0;

            for (int j = i; j < nums.length; j++) {

                sum += nums[j];

                maxSum = Math.max(maxSum, sum);
            }
        }

        return maxSum;
    }
}
Example
Input:
[-2,1,-3,4,-1,2,1,-5,4]

Output:
6
Maximum subarray:
[4,-1,2,1]

Sum = 6
Time Complexity: O(n²)
Space Complexity: O(1)
