Optimized Solution – Kadane's Algorithm
class Solution {
    public int maxSubArray(int[] nums) {

        int currentSum = nums[0];
        int maxSum = nums[0];

        for (int i = 1; i < nums.length; i++) {

            currentSum = Math.max(
                nums[i],
                currentSum + nums[i]
            );

            maxSum = Math.max(maxSum, currentSum);
        }

        return maxSum;
    }
}
Time: O(n)
Space: O(1)
Brute Force vs Optimized
Method	Time	Space
Brute Force	O(n²)	O(1)
Kadane	O(n)	O(1)
