Task 2: The Birthday Bar – HackerRank
Problem
Find the number of contiguous segments having:
•	Length = m 
•	Sum = d 
import java.util.*;

public class Solution {

    public static int birthday(
            List<Integer> s, int d, int m) {

        int count = 0;

        for (int i = 0; i <= s.size() - m; i++) {

            int sum = 0;

            for (int j = i; j < i + m; j++) {
                sum += s.get(j);
            }

            if (sum == d) {
                count++;
            }
        }

        return count;
    }
}
Example
Input:
s = [1,2,1,3,2]
d = 3
m = 2

Output:
2
Segments:
[1,2] = 3
[2,1] = 3
Pattern: Sliding Window.
