Task 6: Alternating Characters – HackerRank
Problem
Find the minimum number of deletions required so that no two adjacent characters are the same.
import java.util.*;

public class Solution {

    public static int alternatingCharacters(String s) {

        int deletions = 0;

        for (int i = 1; i < s.length(); i++) {

            if (s.charAt(i) == s.charAt(i - 1)) {
                deletions++;
            }
        }

        return deletions;
    }
}
Example
Input:
AABAAB

Output:
2
Remove:
AA → one deletion
AA → one deletion
Total = 2
Time: O(n)
Space: O(1)
